        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Macy's West will provide a pension plan and pension benefits for eligible employees covered under the terms of this Collective Bargaining Agreement consistent with the pension plan and benefits provided to the majority of the Macy's West employees. The pension plan and the benefits shall change when changes are made in the plan affecting the majority of the Macy's West employees.",
